step Divino-matic Rod
  zone map 1446
  tip Sergeant Bly drops it. · At the top of the big pyramid, kill the Sandfury Executioner for the Executioner's Key and open the prisoners' cages. · That starts the stairs event: waves of trolls charge up, and you hold the top. · Clear the elites around the base of the pyramid first or they join the waves. · When the waves are done, kill Bly and his crew for the rod. · ~6,300 XP.
  complete 2768 "Divino-matic Rod"
  note Keep it: you hand this in later on the route.

